'''Snowhill''' is a city directly north of [[Sanctuary]]. It sits high in the mountains, ringed by towering peaks, and is blanketed with a permanent layer of snow. Snowhill is a town devoted to the season of winter, and it has snow all year round. Snowhill not only is a popular attraction for it's looks, but it holds important mining areas, [[Dungeons|dungeons]], and is the only area known to spawn snowballs and have snowball fight [[Mini-Games|minigames]] with other players. It's inhabitants range from [[Wolves|wolves]] to [[Human|humans]]/[[Pixies|pixies]] to [[Yeti|yetis]].

An unusually large pine tree dominates the town, The main road into town leads directly to this tree, and then loops around it. All other roads extend off this loop. Snowhill has many areas to explore, especially for those who enjoy mountain climbing and winter sports.
[[File:Snowhill..webp|thumb|300px]]
==[[Snow Days]]==
During December, Snowhill holds an [[Events|event]] called Snow Days, or alias, Christmas. The giant tree in the heart of Snowhill is known as the [[The Gifting Tree|Gifting Tree]]. On top is a pretty star with lights, and it literally pops out presents. The [[Snowman|Evil Snowmen]] try to steal the presents, but it's up to you to help the people and defeat them.

